<title>USA: Grand Adventures posts 1996 net loss.</title>
<headline>Grand Adventures posts 1996 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grand Adventures Tour &amp; Travel Publishing Corp on Tuesday said its net loss for fiscal 1996, its first year in operation, was $872,655, or $0.09 per share.</p>
<p>Revenue for the year was $11,003,326.</p>
<p>The company said the net loss included extraordinary items related to the acquisition of Airfair Publishing Corp. It did not provide any figures on those extraordinary items.</p>
<p>Grand Adventures Tour provides travel information and services to airline employees and their families.</p>
</text>
